* uic + default-zero initial conditions (no explicit .ic needed: VIN=0
* already matches the desired DAC_TOP=0 cold start). 'save all' at this
* timestep/duration blows ngspice's default output-memory limit (same
* issue documented in the 2026-07-17 figures-export WORKLOG entry) --
* save only the node this analysis needs.
save v(dac_top)
tran 1n 64u uic
wrdata dac/sim/tb_inl_dnl_tran.csv v(DAC_TOP)
.endc
